# Chapter 11, the first milestone: log in, send a message, receive the fixture reply a part at a time,
# then stop a second turn; its later parts are dropped.
tap home.login
type account.email you@example.com
tap account.submit
clock data release auth.email_start
type account.code 123456
tap account.verify
clock data release auth.email_verify
clock data release auth.account
tap shell.new
tap composer.send
type composer.input hello
tap composer.send
state turn
clock data release chat.send
clock data
clock data release chat.part
clock data release chat.part
clock data release chat.part
clock data release chat.done
state transcript
tree
tap reply.copy
state clipboard
type composer.input again
tap composer.send
clock data release chat.send
clock data release chat.part
tap composer.stop
clock data release chat.part
clock data release chat.part
clock data release chat.done
state transcript
logs
